{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03790","headline":"扈从出长安应制 · 杜审言","name":"扈从出长安应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"分野都畿列，时乘六御均。\n京师旧西幸，洛道此东巡。\n文物驱三统，声名走百神。\n龙旗萦漏夕，凤辇拂鈎陈。\n抚迹地灵古，游情皇鉴新。\n山追散马日，水忆钓鱼人。\n禹食传中使，尧樽遍下臣。\n省方称国阜，问道识风淳。\n岁晚天行吉，年丰景从亲。\n欢娱包历代，宇宙忽疑春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜审言","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03790.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03790","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}